    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461">

                <pb facs="0521" n="509" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg509"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.2221/401: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Bordeaux</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >George</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bordeaux</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-05-11T11:00:00+01:00">May 11, 1937—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 11—6:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My telegram of April 7, 11 a.m.<anchor n="66" xml:id="d461-f1"/> Twenty-five
                    Americans held at Toulouse sentenced 40 days imprisonment and will probably be
                    deported. Passports have been delivered to me.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
